# 📦 Mission Delegation Packet (v2.0)

**⚠️ CRITICAL UPDATE:** The architecture has changed to a modular structure using `src/lib/api/`. Do NOT use the old monolithic [src/lib/api.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/lib/api.ts) file.

---

## 🏗️ The New Foundation
**Stable Branch**: `copilot/complete-mission-02-teacher-workbench` (or `main`)
**API Structure**:
```
src/lib/api/
├── index.ts        <-- Main entry point (import { api } from '@/lib/api')
├── types.ts        <-- Shared types (Task, Lesson, APIError)
├── teacher.ts      <-- Teacher actions
├── classroom.ts    <-- Classroom actions
├── self.ts         <-- Self/Wellness actions
└── ... (feature modules)
```

---

