## 🚫 Rules of Engagement
1.  **NEVER create** [src/lib/api.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/lib/api.ts). It is dead.
2.  **ALWAYS import types** from [src/lib/api/types.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/lib/api/types.ts).
3.  **ALWAYS branch** from the latest clean state.
